1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,233
Every Romanian employer must record each
employee's working hours, every day,

2
00:00:04,233 --> 00:00:06,800
and report every hire to the labour
inspectorate.

3
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:11,800
ADMINISTRATIVO does it in one app,
starting from the employee's phone.

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:19,836
At work, the employee scans the poster
with their phone and clocks in.

5
00:00:19,836 --> 00:00:21,800
One tap, no paper.

6
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:26,593
The manager sees the monthly timesheet
fill itself in,

7
00:00:26,593 --> 00:00:31,800
with overtime and night hours, and approves
it. The administrator locks the month.

8
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:36,314
Leave requests follow the company's
approval chain.

9
00:00:36,314 --> 00:00:41,800
Balances update themselves, and the team
calendar shows who is away.

10
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:46,861
Hire someone or change a salary, and the
event is ready for REGES-Online,

11
00:00:46,861 --> 00:00:50,437
the national employee register, with its
legal deadline.

12
00:00:50,437 --> 00:00:55,800
It is filed over the official API, and the
answer comes back to the employee's file.

13
00:00:56,200 --> 00:01:00,075
Health and safety briefings show as a
traffic light:

14
00:01:00,075 --> 00:01:03,800
who is due, who is overdue, and who never
had one.

15
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:08,486
Accountants get the payroll exports, the
tax-return file and the bank file,

16
00:01:08,486 --> 00:01:11,057
and one login for all their client
companies.

17
00:01:11,057 --> 00:01:13,800
Payroll is now in validation with an
accountant.

18
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:17,722
Fleet, inventory, onboarding, courses:

19
00:01:17,722 --> 00:01:21,800
each company gets only the modules it
needs.

20
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:28,375
One flat price per company, from 149 lei a
month, and the first month is free.

21
00:01:28,375 --> 00:01:29,800
administrativo.ro.
